# Results-only commit (benchmark-data convention): the RESULT.md + the NDA-clean
# report JSONs hold the evidence; everything else is a heavy/reproducible artifact
# OR references the commercial PDK by path and must NOT be tracked. Regenerate via
# the Reproduce command in RESULT.md.
#
# Ignore everything under this run dir by default...
*
# ...then re-include ONLY the NDA-verified evidence set.
!.gitignore
!RESULT.md
!reports/
!reports/phase2/
!reports/phase3/
!reports/phase2/*.json
!reports/phase3/*.json
!_logs/
!_logs/flow_compliance_strict.json
